---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Video edit: Diving" windowTitle="web project" showCloseBtn={true}>
  <div class="projectWindow ">

    <div class="lg-4" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <p>I had the opportunity to film and edit a comprehensive video of an open water diving course trip, from start to finish. Using Premiere Pro, I worked on the footage to create a final product that was engaging and told the story of the trip effectively. It was a challenging project for me, as it was my first time working with such a large amount of footage, but I was able to successfully navigate through it all and produce a high-quality end result.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-8" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter yt">
        <iframe width="100%" height="480" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/IR7e39tRRbs" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-8" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter yt">
        <iframe width="100%" height="480" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/fQSjU_a-qvQ" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-4" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <p>I created a promotional video for a diving expo, showcasing the excitement and adventure of diving. Using my skills in video editing and my creative eye, I was able to bring the event to life on screen, capturing the essence of what attendees could expect. This was a challenging project, as I had to condense a lot of information and footage into a short, impactful video. However, with my attention to detail and ability to convey a compelling story, I was able to deliver a video that effectively promoted the diving expo to potential attendees.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
